# The agent tool's own scratch directory, at the repo root only. Both
# patterns must be anchored: an unanchored `superpowers` also matched
# docs/superpowers/, which silently kept the grove delivery plan and the
# phase-0 baseline out of the repo even though six documents link to them.
/superpowers/
/.superpowers/

.DS_Store
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pt
